.TH Command HEADLINES
.SY "headlines [days]"
The headlines command lets you read just the important, subjective, summary
part of the news without boring you with the confusing details.
.s3
If you include a number in the command it will print headlines
based on the news from that many previous days.
.s3
The headline "Relative Calm Prevails" appears whenever the reporters
haven't been able to dig up any interesting tidbits to give the news
analysts.
.s3
The headlines are produced by the editorial staff of the
Empire News who are solely responsible for their lack of content.
.s3
